Kind: widen
Issue: #935
Holds open: delays thread_create_in() 2 ms after it has attached the new thread and before it takes the task lock, so a task_terminate() racing it clears the task's active flag first and the create meets a dead task every time -- the window in which thr_act->thread is set but the task may already be gone
Run: --entry 14 300 -smp 4

